From db2894d285d3a201605a17f4f3a06ce84c7a15b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1vivy <1vivy@tutanota.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 10:30:44 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] infiniti: Restore the device OEM camera layer closure

The OEM camera layer is an ABI closure: camera.oemlayer.v2.so, its adapter,
healthmonitor, logger and uilayer siblings, and libsensorbridge must all come
from one donor. infiniti ships an older generation than macan/macanc/fairlady,
so a shared copy crashes the camera provider in
OemLayer::OCommonContext::InitFallbackController during stream configuration.

Declare the whole closure per device, import the common camera namespace so
com.oplus.node.preview.v2 can still resolve camera.oemlayer.uilayer, and add a
copy rule for the 32-bit libsensorbridge, which has no 32-bit source and would
otherwise be dropped from odm.img.
---
 proprietary-files.txt | 12 ++++++++----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/proprietary-files.txt b/proprietary-files.txt
index 58759b9..b685a49 100644
--- a/proprietary-files.txt
+++ b/proprietary-files.txt
@@ -827,6 +827,14 @@ odm/lib64/camera/components/com.oplus.stats.awb.so
 odm/lib64/camera/components/com.oplus.stats.pdlib.so
 odm/lib64/camera/components/libcamxoemsatsoftwarefusionwrapper.so
 odm/lib64/camera/components/libcamxoemsatwrapper.so
+# OEM camera layer: generation-locked to the infiniti donor.
+odm/lib64/hw/camera.oemlayer.v2.so;DISABLE_CHECKELF;DISABLE_DEPS
+odm/lib64/camera.oemlayer.adapter.so;DISABLE_CHECKELF;DISABLE_DEPS
+odm/lib64/camera.oemlayer.healthmonitor.so;DISABLE_CHECKELF;DISABLE_DEPS
+odm/lib64/camera.oemlayer.logger.so;DISABLE_CHECKELF;DISABLE_DEPS
+odm/lib64/camera.oemlayer.uilayer.so;DISABLE_CHECKELF;DISABLE_DEPS
+odm/lib64/libsensorbridge.so
+odm/lib/libsensorbridge.so;MAKE_COPY_RULE_ONLY
 odm/lib64/camera/awb_parameter_default.bin
 odm/lib64/camera/com.qti.sensor.infinitifront.so
 odm/lib64/camera/com.qti.sensor.infinitimain.so
@@ -903,10 +911,6 @@ odm/lib64/bm6a81v08s14n80.bin
 odm/lib64/bm6a81v08s14n83.bin
 odm/lib64/bm6a81v08s14n85.bin
 odm/lib64/bm6a81v08s14n86.bin
-odm/lib64/camera.oemlayer.adapter.so
-odm/lib64/camera.oemlayer.healthmonitor.so
-odm/lib64/camera.oemlayer.logger.so
-odm/lib64/camera.oemlayer.uilayer.so
 odm/lib64/com.oplus.mcx.linearmapper.so
 odm/lib64/com.oplus.node.preview.v2.so
 odm/lib64/lib2DSlender.so
